import{_ as t,o as i,c as a,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const u=JSON.parse('{"title":"The Symbiotic Healthcare System","description":"","frontmatter":{},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0038-共生医疗体系.md","filePath":"en/0038-共生医疗体系.md"}'),n={name:"en/0038-共生医疗体系.md"};function r(l,e,s,c,d,h){return i(),a("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="the-symbiotic-healthcare-system" tabindex="-1">The Symbiotic Healthcare System <a class="header-anchor" href="#the-symbiotic-healthcare-system" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;The Symbiotic Healthcare System&quot;">​</a></h1><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Item</th><th>Content</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Document No.</td><td>38</td></tr><tr><td>Module</td><td>Civilization Typologies and Social Systems</td></tr><tr><td>Keywords</td><td>Symbiotic Healthcare, Cultivation Injuries, Life Circulation, Prevention First, Health for All</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="i-core-concepts-and-goals-of-symbiotic-healthcare" tabindex="-1">I. Core Concepts and Goals of Symbiotic Healthcare <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-core-concepts-and-goals-of-symbiotic-healthcare" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Core Concepts and Goals of Symbiotic Healthcare&quot;">​</a></h2><p>In the era of the Predatory Cultivation System, medical resources were monopolized by a few powerhouses and sects, and the masses at the bottom often could not receive timely and effective treatment when they fell ill or were injured in cultivation. More seriously, predatory cultivation itself was full of risks — cultivation injuries such as Deviation, Energy Rebound, and Law Erosion occurred frequently, and these injuries were often difficult to cure, bringing lifelong pain or even life-threatening danger to cultivators.</p><p>After the establishment of the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, building a symbiotic healthcare system covering all people, prevention-first, and combining cultivation with medicine became one of its core tasks. The core concept of symbiotic healthcare can be summarized in sixteen characters: &quot;Life Circulation, Prevention First, Universal Coverage, Treating Body and Mind Together.&quot;</p><p>The core goals of symbiotic healthcare include:</p><ol><li><strong>Guaranteeing the health of all people</strong>: ensure that every symbiotic life can obtain basic medical protection, and will not lose the right to survival and evolution due to illness or cultivation injury</li><li><strong>Preventing and treating cultivation injuries</strong>: establish a complete system for the prevention, diagnosis, treatment, and rehabilitation of cultivation injuries, safeguarding the safety of cultivators</li><li><strong>Improving the quality of life</strong>: through the combination of medical technology and cultivation methods, enhance the health level and quality of life of lives</li><li><strong>Extending lifespan</strong>: through the application of the Life Circulation System, delay aging, extend lifespan, and provide individuals with more ample time for evolution</li><li><strong>Promoting the health of the Myriad Races</strong>: the healthcare system is open to all races and life forms, providing differentiated medical services according to the physiological characteristics of different races</li></ol><h2 id="ii-the-three-level-service-system-of-symbiotic-healthcare" tabindex="-1">II. The Three-Level Service System of Symbiotic Healthcare <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-the-three-level-service-system-of-symbiotic-healthcare" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. The Three-Level Service System of Symbiotic Healthcare&quot;">​</a></h2><p>According to the service level and functional positioning, the symbiotic healthcare system is divided into three levels, forming a complete medical service network:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Name</th><th>Service Scope</th><th>Core Functions</th><th>Main Facilities</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>First Level</td><td>Primary Healthcare</td><td>Community level</td><td>Basic diagnosis and treatment, health management, preventive care</td><td>Community medical stations, health management centers</td></tr><tr><td>Second Level</td><td>Regional Healthcare</td><td>Star-region level</td><td>Specialized diagnosis and treatment, injury treatment, rehabilitation services</td><td>Regional medical centers, cultivation injury hospitals</td></tr><tr><td>Third Level</td><td>Core Healthcare</td><td>Plane level</td><td>Difficult and severe cases, law treatment, life research</td><td>Plane core hospitals, life science research institutes</td></tr></tbody></table><h3 id="_2-1-primary-healthcare" tabindex="-1">2.1 Primary Healthcare <a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-1-primary-healthcare" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;2.1 Primary Healthcare&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Primary healthcare is the &quot;bottom net&quot; of the symbiotic healthcare system, providing basic medical services to community residents:</p><ul><li><strong>Basic diagnosis and treatment</strong>: diagnosis and treatment of common diseases, provision of basic medicines</li><li><strong>Health management</strong>: establish health records for residents, provide regular physical examinations and health consultations</li><li><strong>Preventive care</strong>: vaccination, disease prevention, health education, etc.</li><li><strong>Cultivation safety guidance</strong>: provide initial cultivators with cultivation safety knowledge and basic injury handling</li><li><strong>Referral services</strong>: for patients beyond the primary treatment capacity, refer them promptly to higher-level medical institutions</li></ul><p>Primary healthcare is characterized by &quot;nearby, convenient, and free&quot; — every community has a medical station, residents can reach it on foot, and basic medical services are completely free.</p><h3 id="_2-2-regional-healthcare" tabindex="-1">2.2 Regional Healthcare <a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-2-regional-healthcare" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;2.2 Regional Healthcare&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Regional healthcare is the &quot;backbone&quot; of the symbiotic healthcare system, providing specialized medical services to residents within the star region:</p><ul><li><strong>Specialized diagnosis and treatment</strong>: establish specialized departments such as cultivation injury, energy metabolism, law erosion, and mental psychology</li><li><strong>Injury treatment</strong>: provide professional treatment and rehabilitation services for patients with cultivation injuries</li><li><strong>Surgical treatment</strong>: carry out various routine surgeries and energy surgeries</li><li><strong>Rehabilitation services</strong>: provide rehabilitation training and care for postoperative patients and chronic disease patients</li><li><strong>Emergency services</strong>: establish emergency centers to respond to sudden medical emergencies</li></ul><p>Regional healthcare is characterized by &quot;professional, comprehensive, and low-cost&quot; — regional medical centers have complete specialized departments and professional medical teams, service fees are low, and most costs are covered by public medical protection.</p><h3 id="_2-3-core-healthcare" tabindex="-1">2.3 Core Healthcare <a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-3-core-healthcare" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;2.3 Core Healthcare&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Core healthcare is the &quot;apex&quot; of the symbiotic healthcare system, providing top-level medical services to patients with difficult and severe diseases within the plane:</p><ul><li><strong>Diagnosis and treatment of difficult and severe cases</strong>: admit difficult and severe cases that primary and regional healthcare cannot treat</li><li><strong>Law treatment</strong>: use law-level medical technology to treat diseases that conventional methods cannot cure</li><li><strong>Life science research</strong>: carry out frontier research in life science, cultivation medicine, energy medicine, etc.</li><li><strong>Advanced rehabilitation</strong>: provide advanced rehabilitation services for severe patients, helping them recover their cultivation ability</li><li><strong>Cross-Plane medical collaboration</strong>: collaborate with core medical institutions of other planes, sharing medical resources and technologies</li></ul><p>Core healthcare is characterized by &quot;top-level, frontier, and fully guaranteed&quot; — core hospitals have the plane&#39;s most outstanding medical teams and technological equipment, and the treatment costs of difficult and severe cases are fully borne by public medical protection.</p><h2 id="iii-core-technology-systems-of-symbiotic-healthcare" tabindex="-1">III. Core Technology Systems of Symbiotic Healthcare <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-core-technology-systems-of-symbiotic-healthcare" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Core Technology Systems of Symbiotic Healthcare&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Symbiotic healthcare deeply integrates traditional medicine with cultivation technology and engineering technology, forming a unique medical technology system:</p><h3 id="_3-1-life-circulation-treatment-technology" tabindex="-1">3.1 Life Circulation Treatment Technology <a class="header-anchor" href="#_3-1-life-circulation-treatment-technology" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;3.1 Life Circulation Treatment Technology&quot;">​</a></h3><p>The Life Circulation System (the 2nd of the Three Hundred Origin Cultivation Systems) has broad applications in the medical field:</p><ul><li><strong>Energy circulation repair</strong>: guide the benign circulation of life energy within the patient&#39;s body to repair damaged tissues and organs</li><li><strong>Metabolism regulation</strong>: regulate the patient&#39;s metabolic rate, accelerating injury repair and disease recovery</li><li><strong>Genetic evolution repair</strong>: repair damaged genes and origins through life circulation technology</li><li><strong>Aging delay</strong>: delay cellular aging through life circulation technology, extending healthy lifespan</li></ul><h3 id="_3-2-cultivation-injury-treatment-technology" tabindex="-1">3.2 Cultivation Injury Treatment Technology <a class="header-anchor" href="#_3-2-cultivation-injury-treatment-technology" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;3.2 Cultivation Injury Treatment Technology&quot;">​</a></h3><p>For common injuries in the cultivation process, symbiotic healthcare has developed specialized treatment technologies:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Injury Type</th><th>Treatment Method</th><th>Treatment Cycle</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Deviation</td><td>Energy dredging + consciousness repair + law stabilization</td><td>Days to months</td></tr><tr><td>Energy Rebound</td><td>Energy neutralization + tissue repair + energy core reconstruction</td><td>Weeks to months</td></tr><tr><td>Law Erosion</td><td>Law stripping + origin repair + protection reconstruction</td><td>Months to years</td></tr><tr><td>Meridian Damage</td><td>Energy surgery + meridian regeneration + rehabilitation training</td><td>Weeks to months</td></tr><tr><td>Mental Trauma</td><td>Consciousness healing + psychological counseling + memory repair</td><td>Weeks to years</td></tr></tbody></table><h3 id="_3-3-energy-medicine-technology" tabindex="-1">3.3 Energy Medicine Technology <a class="header-anchor" href="#_3-3-energy-medicine-technology" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;3.3 Energy Medicine Technology&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Energy medicine is a characteristic field of symbiotic healthcare, diagnosing and treating diseases through energy means:</p><ul><li><strong>Energy diagnosis</strong>: accurately diagnose diseases by detecting the patient&#39;s energy fluctuations, energy field distribution, energy channel status, etc.</li><li><strong>Energy treatment</strong>: treat diseases by inputting energy of specific frequencies and forms to regulate the patient&#39;s energy balance</li><li><strong>Energy surgery</strong>: use energy scalpels for non-invasive or minimally invasive surgery, reducing surgical trauma</li><li><strong>Energy medicines</strong>: combine medicines with energy to enhance efficacy and reduce side effects</li></ul><h3 id="_3-4-preventive-medicine-technology" tabindex="-1">3.4 Preventive Medicine Technology <a class="header-anchor" href="#_3-4-preventive-medicine-technology" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;3.4 Preventive Medicine Technology&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Symbiotic healthcare emphasizes &quot;prevention first&quot; and has developed complete preventive medicine technologies:</p><ul><li><strong>Health monitoring</strong>: monitor individuals&#39; health status in real time through wearable devices and the symbiotic network</li><li><strong>Risk early warning</strong>: warn of disease risks in advance based on health data and artificial intelligence</li><li><strong>Vaccine technology</strong>: develop corresponding vaccines for various infectious diseases and energy diseases</li><li><strong>Health preservation</strong>: improve individuals&#39; health levels through cultivation health preservation, dietary regulation, lifestyle guidance, etc.</li></ul><h2 id="iv-guarantee-mechanisms-of-symbiotic-healthcare" tabindex="-1">IV. Guarantee Mechanisms of Symbiotic Healthcare <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-guarantee-mechanisms-of-symbiotic-healthcare" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Guarantee Mechanisms of Symbiotic Healthcare&quot;">​</a></h2><h3 id="_4-1-universal-medical-protection" tabindex="-1">4.1 Universal Medical Protection <a class="header-anchor" href="#_4-1-universal-medical-protection" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;4.1 Universal Medical Protection&quot;">​</a></h3><p>The symbiotic civilization ensures that every symbiotic life can obtain basic medical protection through the Medical Protection Law:</p><ul><li><strong>Free basic healthcare</strong>: primary healthcare services and basic medicines are completely free</li><li><strong>Low-cost regional healthcare</strong>: individuals only need to pay a small amount for regional medical services; most is covered by public protection</li><li><strong>Full protection for severe cases</strong>: the treatment costs of difficult and severe cases are fully borne by public medical protection</li><li><strong>Care for special groups</strong>: provide additional medical assistance for poor groups, disabled lives, special races, etc.</li></ul><h3 id="_4-2-medical-talent-cultivation" tabindex="-1">4.2 Medical Talent Cultivation <a class="header-anchor" href="#_4-2-medical-talent-cultivation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;4.2 Medical Talent Cultivation&quot;">​</a></h3><p>The symbiotic civilization has established a complete medical talent cultivation system:</p><ul><li><strong>Medical college education</strong>: establish dedicated cultivation medical colleges to cultivate various medical talents</li><li><strong>Master-apprentice inheritance</strong>: senior physicians cultivate specialized medical talents through master-apprentice inheritance</li><li><strong>Continuous training</strong>: medical personnel must participate in regular training to continuously update knowledge and technology</li><li><strong>Cross-Plane exchange</strong>: organize medical personnel to exchange and study across planes, improving medical standards</li></ul><h3 id="_4-3-medical-resource-allocation" tabindex="-1">4.3 Medical Resource Allocation <a class="header-anchor" href="#_4-3-medical-resource-allocation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;4.3 Medical Resource Allocation&quot;">​</a></h3><p>The symbiotic civilization guarantees the rational allocation of medical resources through various means:</p><ul><li><strong>Public financial investment</strong>: government finances give priority to medical investment; medical expenditure must not be lower than the legally prescribed proportion of public expenditure</li><li><strong>Balanced regional allocation</strong>: through policy guidance, ensure the balanced allocation of medical resources across regions</li><li><strong>Telemedicine</strong>: realize telemedicine through the Anchor Network, allowing patients in remote areas to also obtain quality medical services</li><li><strong>Social forces participation</strong>: encourage sects, enterprises, non-profit organizations, and other social forces to participate in medical services</li></ul><h3 id="_4-4-medical-ethics-and-supervision" tabindex="-1">4.4 Medical Ethics and Supervision <a class="header-anchor" href="#_4-4-medical-ethics-and-supervision" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;4.4 Medical Ethics and Supervision&quot;">​</a></h3><p>The symbiotic civilization has established a strict medical ethics and supervision system:</p><ul><li><strong>Medical ethics guidelines</strong>: formulate detailed medical ethics guidelines to regulate the conduct of medical personnel</li><li><strong>Medical quality supervision</strong>: establish a medical quality monitoring system to ensure medical safety and quality</li><li><strong>Medical dispute handling</strong>: establish a fair and efficient medical dispute handling mechanism</li><li><strong>Medical technology admission</strong>: new medical technologies must undergo strict ethical review and safety assessment before clinical application</li></ul><h2 id="v-differences-in-medical-models-of-the-five-civilization-types" tabindex="-1">V. Differences in Medical Models of the Five Civilization Types <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-differences-in-medical-models-of-the-five-civilization-types" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Differences in Medical Models of the Five Civilization Types&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The five symbiotic civilization types have their own characteristics in medical models:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Type</th><th>Medical Model Features</th><th>Advantages</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>East Asian Intensive Type</td><td>Large-scale, standardized, integration of traditional and modern medicine</td><td>High efficiency, wide coverage</td></tr><tr><td>Nordic Welfare Type</td><td>High welfare, high equality, prevention first</td><td>Good fairness, high health level</td></tr><tr><td>North American Pluralistic Type</td><td>Market-oriented, high-end medical care, technological innovation</td><td>Advanced technology, strong top-level medical care</td></tr><tr><td>Continental European Social Type</td><td>Social medical insurance, associational participation</td><td>Strong stability, labor-capital harmony</td></tr><tr><td>Developing Catch-up Type</td><td>Basic first, rapid popularization, focused breakthroughs</td><td>Fast popularization, controllable costs</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The symbiotic healthcare system is the &quot;health guardian&quot; of the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization. Through the three-level medical service system, core medical technology systems, and complete guarantee mechanisms, symbiotic healthcare provides every symbiotic life with comprehensive health protection from prevention to treatment, from basic to high-end. The popularization and quality of healthcare not only guarantee individuals&#39; rights to survival and evolution, but also lay a solid health foundation for the advancement of the Myriad Races of the entire civilization.</p><h2 id="related-documents" tabindex="-1">Related Documents <a class="header-anchor" href="#related-documents" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related Documents&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>44-医疗保障法 (Medical Protection Law)</li><li>12-生命循环体系详解 (Detailed Explanation of the Life Circulation System)</li><li>32-北欧福利型文明 (Nordic Welfare Civilization)</li></ul>',56)])])}const g=t(n,[["render",r]]);export{u as __pageData,g as default};
